OL,3,GNEWSASchool forced to close due to
OL,4,Awater leaks 'in all areas' of building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school has been forced to
OL,7,Fclose on Friday due to a "huge number
OL,8,Fof water leaks in all areas of the
OL,9,Fschool" amid ongoing roof issues, the
OL,10,Fprincipal has said.
OL,12,FEamonn Moore from St Oliver Plunkett
OL,13,FPrimary School, in Strathfoyle, County
OL,14,FLondonderry, said rain water is now
OL,15,Fentering every classroom and shared
OL,16,Farea of the building.
OL,18,FMoore said water is lying in numerous
OL,19,Fareas and, to safeguard pupils, they
OL,20,Fhad to take the difficult decision to
OL,21,Fapply for an exceptional closure day.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
