OL,3,GNEWSASchool forced to close due to
OL,4,Awater leaks 'in all areas' of building
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoore said the school has called an
OL,7,Femergency meeting with Education
OL,8,FAuthority (EA) officials, chair of
OL,9,Fgovernors and roofing contractors for
OL,10,FFriday. The EA has been contacted for a
OL,11,Fresponse.
